{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype(v_1) = 11 then ndim(v_1) = 0 else true
>>
Rule 27 (If the tensor has exactly one element, then that element cannot be zero)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1 then min(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ max(v_1) ≠ 0 else true
>>
Rule 28 (The first shape dimension must be odd)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) / 2 ≠ shape(v_1, 0) / 2.0
>>
